+                        InputManager.INJECT_INPUT_EVENT_MODE_ASYNC);
+            }
+        }, 32);
+    }
+
+    private ImageButton button(int icon, String label, Runnable click) {
+        // These vectors resolve their path alpha from singleToneColor. The
+        // application context has no icon theme; tint alone cannot revive a
+        // transparent path. Use the same dual-tone theme as native navigation.
+        ImageButton result = new ImageButton(new android.view.ContextThemeWrapper(
+                mContext, R.style.DualToneLightTheme));
